ames and terms are encountered, the Codex can be your guide to Neo Elysia, its citizens, locations and institutions!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scene Gallery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to peruse some of the hot moments you\u2019ve already encountered and perhaps give some of them another gander? We\u2019ve got you covered. In the Scene Gallery, you can replay some of your favorite FUNS moments again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t have the patience to unlock those scenes in the first place? Well, that\u2019s on you, but we\u2019ve already planned with you in mind. The ability to unlock all scenes in the gallery at the click of a button is available to you right from the start of the game. The choice is yours!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Episode Select</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Had a save file a while back, but it got lost somehow? What a pain. Thankfully FUNS has an Episode Select feature that allows you to skip to the episode you wish quickly and painlessly. Just answer a few quick questions and you\u2019ll be back in the story, right where you left off. Easy as pie.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584290/extras/d1c0daf47243ef3a8e38c6f100b67500.avif?t=1753903902\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development and Future of FUNS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since you have read this far: Thank you so much for your time and interest in FUNS! If you would like to follow the game's development, we will be posting monthly updates in the Steam community forum, documenting our progress on the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We also offer ways to play the game's current build before the official Steam release, allowing you to get a taste of FUNS whenever you desire. You can find out about how to get access by visiting our website (you can find the link to our website in the aforementioned